# ─── Licensed source data — MUST NEVER be committed ───────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC. SNOMED CT, DDInter, RxNorm/UMLS and CredibleMeds
# content are all restricted in ways that a public commit would breach
# (SNOMED Affiliate Licence, CC BY-NC-SA, UMLS Metathesaurus Licence,
# CredibleMeds ToU). See docs/plan/08-licensing.md.
#
# These rules are a COMPLIANCE CONTROL, not tidiness. Do not "fix" a missing
# data file by committing it. Sources are pinned by SHA-256 in sources.lock and
# fetched locally — that is the reproducibility mechanism (docs/plan/04).

snomed-releases/*
!snomed-releases/.gitkeep
!snomed-releases/README.md

ddinter/
rxnorm/
umls/
credible-meds/
cdc-india/
drugbank/

# Belt and braces: the same content unpacked somewhere unexpected
SnomedCT_*/
*_RF2_*.zip
sct2_*.txt
der2_*.txt
RXN*.RRF
MRCONSO.RRF
*.rf2
*.rf2.zip

# Any local scratch or extract area
data/
scratch/
tmp/

# ─── Build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.ddi
*.ddi.sig
/dist/
/build/
ddid
ddictl

# ─── Secrets and local config ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/testdata/**/*.key
overlay.local.yaml

# ─── Tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
